File: contrib/libtests/pngvalid.c
Line: 2232
Function: normalize_color_encoding
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: Divides multiple components by whiteY when (whiteY != 1) but does not guard against whiteY == 0, leading to division by zero if red.Y + green.Y + blue.Y equals 0.

